From 9a9a463ca4a49953dc0f91b650e8c9098cd01f71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:48:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] OpenACC field operations

MGIS/FieldOperations/OpenACCFieldOperations.hxx: copies and fills of views
located in the memory of the current device of OpenACC (acc_malloc), with
the parallel loop construct of OpenACC, compiled by the calling code with
its OpenACC compiler, as the OpenMP header. A copy between two views with
the same dense layout is a copy of the runtime (acc_memcpy_device). The
operations are synchronous. This is the counterpart of the openacc backend
of MFront.

Documentation: views, generic-parallel interfaces, release notes, C++
bindings, comments of the headers listing the backends.
